; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;-&gt;&#160; Seq Scan on ligne l&#160; (cost=0.00..1.61 rows=61 width=29) (actual time=0.016..0.031 rows=61 loops=1)<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;-&gt;&#160; Index Scan using pk_of on o_f oo&#160; (cost=0.00..4.27 rows=1 width=38) (actual time=0.017..0.018 rows=1 loops=3)<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;Index Cond: ((p.of_sec)::text = (oo.of_sec)::text)<br /> Total runtime: 39.414 ms<br />(30 rows)</p><p>Oui, le track_functions est activé.</p><p>Je vais lire votre article de suite.</p>]]></content>
